6f5c51e634469"}, "language": "english", "review": "As of today, I have requested a refund on Arma 3. I came to realize that 30 dollars was a lot of money for a game that is only really worth 10. But 30 dollars wasn't the end of it, DLCs cost 10 dollars each and there's quite a few of them. Unless you want to pay an ungodly amount of money for a game that isn't really that good anymore, don't buy Arma 3. Of course you can ignore my negative review and get the game anyway... and then 2 days later request a refund because you're sick and tired of paywalls blocking you out of the real fun, or just bored of ♥♥♥♥♥♥ multiplayer servers. That's what I did. Anyways if you want a fun combat game and you are into tanks, I suggest buying GHPC. You can find GHPC on steam for 30 dollars or you can find it online as a demo for free. To whoever reads this, have a good day!", "timestamp_created": 1666550180, "timestamp_updated": 1666550180, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496774196624755859", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}